      "message": "docs(process): resolve-conflicts review nits - undo-ready for any ready PR, delta review may set needs-maintainer (PROCESS_VERSION 4)\n\nFrom the #685 review:\n- A contributor's PR still marked ready also goes back to draft before\n  the merge-of-main push (not only our own); if the runner can't undo it,\n  the comment asks for it to be re-flagged after the re-check.\n- The maintainer's delta review can set any review-prs label, including\n  needs-maintainer when the merge brings in a dependency, build.rs,\n  script or .github change.\n\n.claude/PROCESS_VERSION 3 -> 4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
